DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261030
SUMMARY:ECB monetary-policy decision
DESCRIPTION:How are euro-area financing and demand conditions changing?\nIn
 spect: Decision\, financing discussion and later bank lending data.\nImpro
 vement: Credit availability and real demand improve.\nDeterioration: Tight
 er financing coincides with weaker demand.\nLimits: The ECB held its three
  key rates on 29 October. The decision does not establish a specific borro
 wer's financing costs or credit availability.\nCheck date: 2026-11-17\nOut
 come status: unresolved\nhttps://www.ecb.europa.eu/press/pr/date/2026/html
 /ecb.mp261029~9a493adf17.en.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
